            @if (isFaqDisplayed)
            {
                <div class="container p-5">
                    <div class="faq-style">
                        <div class="row">
                            <label class="heading-secondary text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</label>

                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">1. What is Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Cinnamon Events is the Philippines' all-in-one online platform for discovering and managing events. We provide tools for event organizers to create, promote, and manage their events seamlessly, while offering attendees a curated space to find events tailored to their interests.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">2. How is Cinnamon Events different from other event platforms?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Unlike generic global platforms, Cinnamon Events is focused on the Philippines. We offer a localized experience, featuring events from all corners of the country, and cater to the unique needs of Filipino organizers and attendees.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">3. How can I create an event on Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Creating an event is easy! Simply sign up for an organizer account, fill out the event details, set ticket prices (if applicable), and promote your event through our platform. Our user-friendly interface guides you through the process step-by-step.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">4. What types of events can I find on Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">You can find a wide variety of events on our platform, including: <br>
												  Corporate conferences and seminars <br>
												  Music festivals and concerts <br>
												  Community gatherings and workshops <br>
												  Art exhibitions and cultural events <br>
												  Sports competitions and tournaments <br>
												  ...and much more!</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">5. Is it safe to purchase tickets on Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Yes, we prioritize the security of our ticketing platform. We use secure payment gateways and employ measures to protect both organizers and attendees from fraudulent transactions.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">6. How can I contact Cinnamon Events for support or inquiries?</p>
                                <p class="answer">You can reach us via email at <a href="mailto:support@cinnamon.ph">support@cinnamon.ph</a> or visit our website for more information and contact options.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">7. Does Cinnamon Events offer promotional opportunities for events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Yes, we offer various promotional tools and packages to help event organizers reach a wider audience and increase attendance. Contact us to learn more about our marketing services.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">8. Is Cinnamon Events only for large-scale events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">No, we welcome events of all sizes, from small community gatherings to large-scale corporate conferences. Our platform is designed to cater to the needs of all types of event organizers.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">9. What are Cinnamon Events' future plans?Who are the Activity Providers?</p>
                                <p class="answer">We are constantly working to improve our platform and expand our offerings. We aim to become the leading event platform in the Philippines, providing innovative solutions and fostering a thriving event community.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">10. How do I sign up for a Cinnamon Events account?</p>
                                <p class="answer">You can easily create an account on our website. Click on the "Sign Up" button and follow the instructions to create either an organizer or attendee account.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">11. Is there a fee to use Cinnamon Events as an attendee?</p>
                                <p class="answer">No, creating an attendee account and browsing events on our platform is completely free. You only pay for tickets if you choose to attend a ticketed event.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">12. How do I get my event featured on Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">We regularly feature events on our homepage and social media channels. To increase your chances of getting featured, ensure your event listing is complete, engaging, and includes high-quality images. You can also contact us to discuss promotional opportunities.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">13. Can I host a virtual event on Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Yes, we support both in-person and virtual events. You can specify the format of your event when creating the listing.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">14. Does Cinnamon Events offer refunds for canceled events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Refund policies vary depending on the event organizer. Please refer to the specific event listing for details on the refund policy.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">15. How does Cinnamon Events support local communities?</p>
                                <p class="answer">We believe in the power of events to bring communities together. We actively seek out and promote events hosted by local organizations and businesses, contributing to the growth and vibrancy of local communities across the Philippines.</p>
                            </div>		
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">16. Can I suggest an event to be listed on Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Yes, we welcome suggestions! If you know of an event that would be a good fit for our platform, please contact us with the details.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">17. How can I stay updated on the latest events and news from Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Follow us on social media (Facebook, Linkedin, and Instagram) and subscribe to our newsletter to receive regular updates on upcoming events, special offers, and exciting news.</p>
                            </div>	
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">18. Does Cinnamon Events have a mobile app?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Not yet, but we are working on developing a mobile app for a more convenient user experience on the go. Stay tuned for updates!</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">19. I'm an event organizer. How can I get started with Cinnamon Events?</p>
                                <p class="answer">Create an organizer account and start listing your events today! We have a dedicated support team to assist you throughout the process.</p>
                            </div>		
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="question">20. I'm experiencing technical difficulties on the website. What should I do?</p>
                                <p class="answer">We apologize for any inconvenience. Please try refreshing the page or clearing your browser cache. If the problem persists, contact our support team with a detailed description of the issue, and we'll be happy to assist you.</p>
                            </div>										
                            <div class="col-sm-12 p-2">
                                <p class="answer">For any other concerns, you may contact us through <a href="mailto:support@cinnamon.ph">support@cinnamon.ph</a> or send us a message on Facebook.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
